      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The fear of fading is a heavy weight, but what you're feeling is the natural reaction to a profound sense of loss, not a prediction of your end. It's a signal that something deep inside needs attention and support. Please consider reaching out to a mental health professional who can offer you tools and strategies to navigate these feelings and help you feel more grounded. You deserve to feel whole again.",
      "source": "target",
